   "title": "Abweichungen",
   "description": "Every control the committed assessment does not report as satisfied. Three of them -- GC.9.1.1.1 to .3 -- are deliberate and permanent: independence, deputies and separation of duties are unachievable with one operator, and they are carried as a visible deviation rather than excluded.",
